flowchart TD
    A([Start addUniqueRom]) --> B[Convert ROM to uppercase]
    B --> C[Trim whitespace from ROM]

    C --> D{uniqueRomCount < 14?}

    D -- No --> E([End])
    D -- Yes --> F{isRomUnique?}

    F -- No --> E
    F -- Yes --> G[Store ROM in uniqueRoms array]
    G --> H[Increment uniqueRomCount]

    H --> E
